WEBVTT

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.230
I'm back.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:09.080
I spent my summer at a 
place in the mountains.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:13.510
I beat up some cutesy couples 
at the tennis court,

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.660
Fought some grade schoolers over who

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.310
would get their radio exercises 
card stamped first,

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:23.400
caught more stag beetles 
than I really should have...

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:27.000
Well, I guess I had good time, but...

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.140
I really would have liked 
it if you were there,

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.440
Souta-kyun!

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:42.050
Kyun! Kyun!

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:42.640
Shut up!

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:52.860
Oh, Hatate-kun, it's been a while.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:56.340
I was sad, not being able 
to see you for a month.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.870
Hello there.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.370
Hi there.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:09.210
Who is this?!

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:20.310
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:44.010
<b>Flag 10</b>

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:44.010
<b>Hold This for Me. 
The Winner of the Beauty Contest is Written Here.</b>

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:46.020
Okay.

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:51.980
New friend

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:50.750
We have a new friend for you all today.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:51.980
Clap, clap.

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:55.960
I'm from the Principality of Bladefield,

00:02:54.230 --> 00:03:00.490
<b>Hakua B. Bladefield</b>

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:59.680
the second crown princess, 
Hakua Berserker Bladefield,

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.500
I am.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.180
She's more of a princess than Knight-san.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:08.050
I feel like I want to protect 
her more than Knight-san.

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:10.290
She smells better than Knight-san.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.700
She's a real princess.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:14.960
I'm a real princess, too!

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:17.000
Okay.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.090
We'll be starting the new term today.

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:22.080
The school fair's coming up,
so make sure you all behave,

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.130
along with your new friend here.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:26.780
Okay!

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:40.270
We just got off of summer break

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:42.530
and now everyone's excited 
about the school fair.

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:44.450
You can't blame them.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:48.280
It's the largest festival around here. 
It lasts for a week

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:50.950
and everyone from the elementary school 
division to the university here participate.

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:55.320
My class wants to make their 
haunted yakisoba café a success,

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.500
so they're all excited.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:04:00.470
What kind of chemical reaction created that idea?

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:02.290
I'm not sure about that one.

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:07.510
Hakua-chan has gotten really used to school.

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:09.500
That's good.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:13.130
I can't always watch after her, anyway.

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:14.760
Souta-kun...

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:15.690
Souta-san,

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:19.900
please sign this, please.

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:21.160
Sign?

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.530
This isn't marriage paperwork.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.360
I... I would be happy

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:28.950
just to be your lover, I would.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.830
Lover

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:31.830
That'd be an <i>annoying</i> way to live.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:34.580
Well, I wouldn't mind signing it.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.510
Yay!

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:37.710
Huh? What?

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:39.850
Souta-kun, look at this...

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:43.600
It's an entry sheet for the 
Hatagaya Academy beauty contest?

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.230
Hatagaya beauty contest?

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:46.900
What's that?

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.550
You don't know?

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:52.600
It's one of the main attractions 
for the first day of the festival.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.140
Sorry, Hatate-kun.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.770
This is for the festival.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.900
Everyone said that if you put their name in,

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:01.070
they wouldn't mind entering.

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:02.590
Everyone?

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.570
<b>Entry Sheet</b>

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.570
<b>Name</b>

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.570
Mahougasawa Akane

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:09.700
<b>Miss Hatagaya Academy Beauty Contest</b>

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:05.580
Mahougasawa Akane.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.320
<b>Entry Sheet</b>

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.320
<b>Name</b>

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.320
Shoukanji Kikuno

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:07.430
Shoukanji Kikuno...

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.700
<b>Entry Sheet</b>

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.700
<b>Name</b>

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.700
Nanami K. Bladefield

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:09.700
Nanami Knight Bladefield.

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:12.730
Ruri and Mei, Hakua and Rin-kun...

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:14.190
The president and Megumu are here, too?!

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:16.830
What?! Why me?

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:24.390
You sure are nice, little Souta.

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:27.320
I've never heard of someone putting in a word

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.010
for nine girls at the same time.

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:33.290
How unscrupulous.

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:34.660
Aren't you happy that

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:38.430
he wanted you to enter, though?

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.440
Wh-What are you saying?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:44.350
I'm not going to get happy 
over something like that.

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:46.790
You get so embarrassed. It's cute.

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:48.310
No, I don't!

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:51.460
So, since you nominated them all,

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:54.870
you're going to need to 
treat them all equally.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.250
My class is supposed to help me out.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.260
Well, it is the school fair.

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:01.710
You're still young.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.000
You should have fun with everyone.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.630
Have fun with everyone, huh?

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:17.450
Why am I a maid?

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:22.560
I wonder why Japan likes 
maids so much, I do.

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:23.610
Uh...

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:26.360
You two look good.

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:33.320
I'll be a perfectly manly maid!

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:36.370
Welcome back, Master.

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:40.330
I'll lower my head for you, even if I am

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.880
the second crown princess, Souta-san.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.010
<b>Social status</b>

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:45.810
Dealing with social status is annoying...

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:50.510
You don't have to worry about getting 
ready for the beauty contest, Nanami?

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.890
I wasn't interested in the first place.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:55.950
Why did you let me enter you?

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:58.960
If I hadn't allowed myself to be entered,

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:01.150
everyone would think I wasn't 
being friendly with them.

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:04.150
What's wrong?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.350
Nothing.

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:07.780
Huh?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:10.650
Hey.

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:14.660
This is the poster for the 
beauty contest, so smile.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:16.120
R-Right.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.290
You okay?

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.980
You're always smiling, and now you...

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:22.680
I-It's not like I'm some 
sort of smiling expert.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:25.540
I look gloomy all the time, just like you!

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:28.300
You shouldn't be comparing yourself to me.

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.940
How about you try taking the picture?

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.170
Come on.

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:38.180
Okay, I'll take your picture, Akane.

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:39.850
O-Okay!

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:48.860
It's been a while since I've been in 
a room without anyone else around.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:51.240
I guess it's not surprising.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:55.990
Everyone's trying their best 
for this fair business.

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:00.500
I can't enjoy myself, Granny-sama.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:14.210
I can't get that fairy tale out of my head.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.100
<b>To Hatate Souta</b>

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:21.040
I found some stuff I thought were clues.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.100
I thought everything would work.

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:28.470
But nothing did.

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:32.540
No matter how much fun I have,

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.210
in the end...

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.550
Just like that boy that was the flag...

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:40.260
Oh, you're awake.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:42.330
N-Nanami.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.750
Your door was open.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.580
O-Oh.

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.090
Did something happen?

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:49.710
Huh?

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:51.710
No, nothing.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.970
Are you worrying about something 
on your own again?

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.470
Wh-What?

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:02.110
Never mind.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.490
It's already so late.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.410
Of course you'd be hungry.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.650
Guess I'll get a late 
night snack or something.

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:22.680
I want to go, too.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:23.840
Me, too.

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:26.460
Then we should get some 
people together to go.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.250
Count me in first!

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.500
Count me in second!

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:32.550
What about you guys? Okiku-nee, Hakua.

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:38.930
As you can see, Hakua's here, so I can't go.

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:42.860
But it's just a special thing!

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:46.460
A sister is only supposed to let her 
brother sleep on her lap like this!

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:50.190
A sister doesn't need any little sisters 
other than her younger brother's!

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:52.980
You know, she is my little 
sister, not his, right?

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.280
What about you, Ruri?

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.840
I'm charging, so I cannot go.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:00.280
I-I see.

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:02.950
Oh, well.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.500
I'll go with you guys, then.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:13.000
<b>Maid</b>

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.230
Okay, let's go.

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.840
Yeah!

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:26.390
It's kind of strange.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:29.690
Yeah, school at night is kind of exciting.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:34.100
It's almost like we're fairies that 
have wandered into another land.

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:37.190
That was a nice poem, Nanami-chan.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:39.020
Don't say poem!

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.090
What is it?

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:47.410
It went "kyuu."

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:50.860
Your cute stomach went "kyuu."

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:53.900
No. It wasn't me.

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:55.460
S-Sorry.

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:59.870
That's the sound that plays when 
I get a text from my sister.

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:01.760
Why do you have that?!

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:06.270
Souta-kun, it said "kyuu, kyuu!"

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:07.640
"Kyuu, kyuu!"

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:08.180
Hey.

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:09.900
"Kyuu, kyuu, kyuu!"

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:11.690
"Kyuu, kyuu, kyuu!"

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.830
"Kyuu... Kyuu..."

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.590
Not you, too, Megumu.

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:16.200
"Kyuu!"

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:21.050
"Kyuu... Kyuu... Kyuu..."

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:19.890
You, too, Nanami?!

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:22.570
H-Hey!

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:26.840
Why is everyone so excited 
the night before the fair?

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:46.630
Souta-kun, why was that so funny?

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:49.330
You only thought of that now?

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:57.110
I don't really get it, but I guess 
Megu thought that was funny.

00:11:57.470 --> 00:11:58.680
Why?

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:14.320
<i>I guess I won't worry about it.</i>

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:18.720
<i>I'll do what I can right now.</i>

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.310
<i>I want everyone to be 
happy while they can be.</i>

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.340
So it's time to

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:32.690
start the Hatagaya Academy school fair!

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:35.030
And we're off!

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:36.560
We get a week long school fair!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:39.690
And the opening event 
that everyone must see...

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:43.400
<b>Miss Hatagaya Academy Beauty Contest</b>

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:42.550
It's the Miss Hatagaya Academy beauty contest!

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:46.650
I'll be your host, the ace 
of the broadcast team,

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:48.270
Kondawara Fuu,

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:51.740
and... Me, Nonomiya Yoshiko!

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:54.080
Time to introduce our judges.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:57.170
<b>Ryuukishibara 
Tsumugi</b>

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:56.880
We have a legendary guest with us.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:59.260
She once won 10 contests in a row!

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:01.040
Ryuukishibara Tsumugi!

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:04.010
If only I were 50 years younger...

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:05.090
And...

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:06.400
We have our representative from 
the middle school division:

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:08.100
<b>Daishikyougawa 
Kurumiko</b>

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.140
Daishikyougawa Kurumiko.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:10.350
Huh?

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.950
Ice cream!

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:14.100
Get your ice cream here!

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:18.860
And last we have the person who 
sponsored all of our entrants.

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.020
<b>Hatate 
Souta</b>

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.010
Hatate Souta-kun.

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:23.110
Why are you making me judge this?!

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:26.170
You had all them do this 
and you're saying that?

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:26.960
You suck.

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:30.100
And all of our participants 
are from Quest Dorm.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.050
I see!

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:32.440
If he knows them all personally,

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:35.590
he can keep any problems between
them from getting out of hand!

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:37.790
So much for doing what you're supposed to do.

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:40.040
Okay, let's get started.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.300
<b>Miss Hatagaya Academy Contest</b>

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:42.050
Our first entry,

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.050
<b>Entry #1</b>

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:44.360
Mahougasawa Akane-san.

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.800
M-Mahougasawa Akane-san here.

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:49.130
I like Souta-kun.

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:51.220
Thank you.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.060
I'm Eiyuuzaki Rin.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.610
I-I also like Souta...

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:00.060
Wait... What are you making me say?!

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:02.440
Shoukanji Kikuno here!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.670
I love my little brother and 
the guy close to my heart,

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:07.250
and they're both Sou-kun!

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:11.080
S-Souta-kyu— I mean Hatate-kun...

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.450
Is going to make me happy...

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.240
<i>Peek, peek.</i>

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:14.970
Huh?

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:17.770
Don't stare at me so much, Hatate-kun.

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:18.460
Huh?!

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:20.810
My name is Ninjabayashi Ruri.

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.890
Everything I am belongs to Souta-san.

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:25.670
That's supposed to be for the judges.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:28.550
I-I don't really like

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.220
Hatate Souta at all.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:32.810
Hmph.

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:36.930
I'm happy just having met Souta-san.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:41.210
I could happily die right now, I could.

00:14:41.550 --> 00:14:42.690
Why so serious...

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.130
I'm going to do the best I can...

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:48.600
I swear on the bonds we have together,

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:50.830
that surpass normal manly friendship.

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:55.700
Uh, I'm not really sure why I'm here. 
Guess it's a bit late for that.

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:59.670
I don't get it, but I'm 
sure it's Souta's fault!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:00.210
Huh?

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:03.000
Okay, that's all nine!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.510
So we'll have our audience

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:07.510
vote in real time.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:10.380
First is our swimsuit competition!

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.380
<b>Swimsuit Competition</b>

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:15.410
Huh? This is supposed to be a 
swimsuit competition, right?

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:16.520
Nonomiya-san?

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:17.370
Yes.

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:18.810
Why is everyone

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:21.810
hiding their swimsuit with a shirt?

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:25.150
So what happens when we have Hatate Souta

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:27.000
stand over there with a water gun.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:27.690
Huh?

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:32.610
I know now!

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:35.210
We're having a wet t-shirt 
plus swimsuit competition.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:36.950
That's right!

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:39.690
That's pretty perverse!

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:41.080
But that's what we like!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.860
Now go at it, Hatate-kun.

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:45.000
I can't do that!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.610
Don't get so bothered, Sou-kun.

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:48.680
It's fine.

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:51.530
Come on, spray it all over me.

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:53.270
F-Fine.

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:54.180
Here I go.

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:01.310
Sou-kun, don't get so much on me.

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:07.790
I want lots on me, too!

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:10.490
Spray it all over me, too!

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.380
No...

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:23.960
I want more, Hatate-kun!

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:26.710
I want some, too, Souta-kun!

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:37.230
I want to show you my upgraded 
waterproof features.

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:38.570
Yes or no?

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:45.350
I'll do anything for you Souta-san, I will!

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.110
Ooh!

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:49.110
So cold!

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:50.650
Hey, Souta,

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.860
aren't you getting a little too much on me?

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:00.570
Hey, Souta!

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:03.070
Why are you getting it on me?!

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:04.000
Jump!

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:11.110
<i>What have I done to...</i>

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:13.920
Okay, that brings our swimsuit 
competition to an end!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.300
We have a lot more to go!

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:18.080
Cooking competition!

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:19.890
Karaoke!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:21.930
Quiz competition!

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:28.710
So everyone has the same amount 
of votes from the audience.

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:31.120
And if we add in the votes from our judges...

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:33.740
We got the same amount votes again...

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:36.820
Hey, get it right, judge!

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.810
I can't rate them...

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:39.920
In that case...

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:41.870
We'll have to add another 
competition to settle this.

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:43.660
Our final competition is an

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.540
<b>Ardently Confess Your Love to the Judges</b>

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.610
"ardently confess your love 
to the judges" competition!

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:47.380
Wh—

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:48.790
What the heck?!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.850
You think the audience is going to like

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.930
that in a beauty competition?

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:55.150
They've all seen just how much

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:57.150
these girls are trying to impress Hatate-kun.

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.750
Hatagaya Academy is all about 
wishing the best for these girls,

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:02.060
even if you don't get them yourself!

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:04.790
Okay, Knight-san, you go first.

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.170
Why me?!

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:11.570
Poem fight!!

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:08.120
Fight, Nanami-chan!

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:10.300
Tell him how you feel!

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:20.070
Hmph!

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:31.210
I guess I'm a little less nervous now.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.160
In that case...

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:38.820
To be honest, I don't like you that much.

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:41.060
It started when we first met.

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:44.770
You were a wimp, hated yourself, 
and were always so gloomy.

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.860
You looked like you were carrying the

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:50.450
misfortune of the entire world on your back.

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:53.820
And well, I guess a lot happened.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:57.710
I thought I had seen you 
crack a smile or two,

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.780
but now you're back to your old self.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.240
I thought I should just

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.950
headbutt you again,

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:12.270
but it seems that won't be necessary.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:15.780
I don't know what happened,

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:19.460
but I'm sure you're thinking 
about it in your own way.

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:24.470
So, well...

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:30.730
Thanks for hanging in there.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:37.160
<i>It wasn't like something 
changed because of that.</i>

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:40.820
<i>My fate and the death flag were still...</i>

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:44.610
<i>But someone noticed.</i>

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:46.690
<i>I never thought</i>

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:49.500
<i>that'd make me so happy.</i>

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:52.060
H-Hey, why are you crying?!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.570
Oh, sorry.

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:54.980
I was just a little tired.

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:57.630
Was my confession of love that boring?!

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.160
What's wrong with you guys?!

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:03.780
You care about him so much...

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:06.300
It just touched me.

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:09.410
There's nothing left for us to say.

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:11.610
You won, Princess Nanami.

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:14.310
No, I don't need to win.

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:16.490
You made use of your differing 
attitudes for that speech.

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:19.380
I detected a "tsundere level" of 530,000.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:22.530
Today Nanami's Sou-kun's older sister.

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.670
Points for Knight-san!

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:27.990
She broke through the limit!

00:20:29.190 --> 00:20:31.930
She might as well have won already.

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:32.790
No complaints here!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:36.670
<b>Winner</b>

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:36.650
So that makes Nanami Knight 
Bladefield-san the winner!

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:37.290
What?!

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:40.250
Okay, Nanami-chan, congratulations.

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:40.800
Huh?

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:45.550
What is this even?!

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:48.820
Due to Knight-san's victory she wins the

00:20:48.820 --> 00:20:51.790
right to a date with Souta-kun 
for the school fair

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:54.440
and a free pass to the refreshment stand.

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:56.060
<b>Hatate Souta</b>

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.830
You've been eating quite a bit.

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:08.300
Hmph. I'm going to have the most fun I can.

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:12.000
I mean, you made me say all that stuff.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:12.500
Hey!

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:17.870
Please...

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:19.500
Please hide me!

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:20.830
Huh?

00:23:11.220 --> 00:23:12.550
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:12.550 --> 00:23:14.940
It's time for me to come into the story!

00:23:14.940 --> 00:23:15.790
Huh? What was that?

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:18.340
I said it was finally time for me to be here!

00:23:18.340 --> 00:23:20.240
Sorry, could you say that a bit louder?

00:23:20.240 --> 00:23:22.640
My turn to be here!

00:23:22.640 --> 00:23:24.150
Sorry, I can't hear you. One more time.

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:28.120
Blah! Why aren't you going to introduce me?

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:32.160
Sorry, but there's no flag to spoil 
what's going to happen next episode.

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Flag 11</b>

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>We Don't all Have to Dance. I can Dance by Myself</b>

00:23:33.250 --> 00:23:34.670
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>See you next time!</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Illustration: Okazaki Takeshi
